              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মাশুল — māshul — \"a fee; the price paid (for something)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পার্সেলটা ভারী হলে বেশি মাশুল লাগবে। Pārselṭā bhārī hôle beshi māshul lāgbe. If the parcel is heavy, the fee will be higher."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মাশুল (māshul) is usually traced to Arabic maḥṣūl, \"revenue, produce\", through Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
